  "charamote sagan module": {
    "general": `Sagan Modules are acquired by dismantling Charamotes caught through Fishing. Go to The Business in Fortuna, select the desired amount of Charamotes available, and select the "''Dismantle''" option to extract the components. Each Charamote yields one Sagan Module. They can also be acquired as a drop from taking down an Exploiter Orb, each loot yielding 7-8 units.`,
    "blueprint": `Sagan Modules are acquired by dismantling Charamotes caught through Fishing. Go to The Business in Fortuna, select the desired amount of Charamotes available, and select the "''Dismantle''" option to extract the components. Each Charamote yields one Sagan Module. They can also be acquired as a drop from taking down an Exploiter Orb, each loot yielding 7-8 units.`
  },
  "charc electroplax": {
    "general": `Charc Electroplax are acquired by cutting up Charc Eels caught through Fishing. Go to Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus, select the desired amount of Charc Eels available, and select the "''Cut Fish''" option to extract the components. Each Charc Eel cut yields one Charc Electroplax. Alternatively, Fisher Hai-Luk can sell Charc Electroplax in bundles of 20 among her rotating stock of "'''Daily Specials'''", which can be bought for Platinum.`,
    "blueprint": `Charc Electroplax are acquired by cutting up Charc Eels caught through Fishing. Go to Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus, select the desired amount of Charc Eels available, and select the "''Cut Fish''" option to extract the components. Each Charc Eel cut yields one Charc Electroplax. Alternatively, Fisher Hai-Luk can sell Charc Electroplax in bundles of 20 among her rotating stock of "'''Daily Specials'''", which can be bought for Platinum.`
  },
