  "goopolla spleen": {
    "general": `Goopolla Spleens are acquired by cutting up Goopolla caught through Fishing. Go to Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus, select the desired amount of Goopolla available, and select the "''Cut Fish''" option to extract the components. Each Goopolla cut yields one Goopolla Spleen. Alternatively, Fisher Hai-Luk can sell Goopolla Spleens in bundles of 20 among her rotating stock of "'''Daily Specials'''", which can be bought for Platinum.`,
    "blueprint": `Goopolla Spleens are acquired by cutting up Goopolla caught through Fishing. Go to Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus, select the desired amount of Goopolla available, and select the "''Cut Fish''" option to extract the components. Each Goopolla cut yields one Goopolla Spleen. Alternatively, Fisher Hai-Luk can sell Goopolla Spleens in bundles of 20 among her rotating stock of "'''Daily Specials'''", which can be bought for Platinum.`
  },
