  "gristlebuck": {
    "general": `The blueprint can be acquired by completing the K-Drive Race '''"Muck and Mire"''' on the Cambion Drift. Note: Active races rotate on a daily basis and thus it is not available every day. Blueprints can be reacquired by repeating the relevant race after the blueprint is sold or consumed. Possessing a completed component, or a K-Drive containing the component, does not prevent acquiring its blueprint again.`,
    "blueprint": `The blueprint can be acquired by completing the K-Drive Race '''"Muck and Mire"''' on the Cambion Drift. Note: Active races rotate on a daily basis and thus it is not available every day. Blueprints can be reacquired by repeating the relevant race after the blueprint is sold or consumed. Possessing a completed component, or a K-Drive containing the component, does not prevent acquiring its blueprint again.`
  },
