    "blueprint": "Higasa's blueprint and components can be obtained from Shrine Defense on Saya's Visions, Earth. Access requires completion of Saya's Vigil and Once Awake. Alternatively they can be purchased from Koumei's Shrine in Cetus with Fate Pearl, which are dropped by the Infested Oni at the end of Shrine Defense in quantities of 14-18 (20-24 on The Steel Path). Each component blueprint require 45 and the main blueprint requires 135, totaling 270 Fate Pearls for the whole set."
