  "karkina antenna": {
    "general": `Karkina Antennae are acquired by cutting up Karkina caught through Fishing. Go to Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus, select the desired amount of Karkina available, and select the "''Cut Fish''" option to extract the components. Each Karkina cut yields one Karkina Antenna. Alternatively, Fisher Hai-Luk can sell Karkina Antennae in bundles of 10 among her rotating stock of "'''Daily Specials'''", which can be bought for Platinum.`,
    "blueprint": `Karkina Antennae are acquired by cutting up Karkina caught through Fishing. Go to Fisher Hai-Luk in Cetus, select the desired amount of Karkina available, and select the "''Cut Fish''" option to extract the components. Each Karkina cut yields one Karkina Antenna. Alternatively, Fisher Hai-Luk can sell Karkina Antennae in bundles of 10 among her rotating stock of "'''Daily Specials'''", which can be bought for Platinum.`
  },
