  "maim": {
    "general": "This mod was once acquired by getting 10 Exposure Points in the Operation: Gate Crash Event. Can also be acquired as an end-of-mission reward from accomplishing the Endurance challenge of the Emergency Exit Tactical Alert. It is offered as a periodic item for sale by Baro Ki'Teer, costing and to purchase. Note that Baro Ki'Teer's stock changes with each appearance, and this mod may not be available on a succeeding appearance. It is now available as a possible drop for capturing the Eidolon Hydrolyst.",
    "blueprint": "This mod was once acquired by getting 10 Exposure Points in the Operation: Gate Crash Event. Can also be acquired as an end-of-mission reward from accomplishing the Endurance challenge of the Emergency Exit Tactical Alert. It is offered as a periodic item for sale by Baro Ki'Teer, costing and to purchase. Note that Baro Ki'Teer's stock changes with each appearance, and this mod may not be available on a succeeding appearance. It is now available as a possible drop for capturing the Eidolon Hydrolyst."
  },
  "malignant force": {
    "general": "Originally acquired as a limited-edition reward from participating in The Cicero Crisis (50 points) Can be acquired as a possible drop by killing Corrupted Vor in Orokin Void missions level \u226540 such as Mithra and Mot 25% drop chance; it has 100% drop, but shares this with its counterparts - Pistol Pestilence, Virulent Scourge, Toxic Barrage It was also acquired as a drop from Razorback Armada via killing the Razorback; however, this is no longer possible.",
    "blueprint": "Originally acquired as a limited-edition reward from participating in The Cicero Crisis (50 points) Can be acquired as a possible drop by killing Corrupted Vor in Orokin Void missions level \u226540 such as Mithra and Mot 25% drop chance; it has 100% drop, but shares this with its counterparts - Pistol Pestilence, Virulent Scourge, Toxic Barrage It was also acquired as a drop from Razorback Armada via killing the Razorback; however, this is no longer possible."
  },
