  "panzer vulpaphyla": {
    "general": "Vulpaphylas are acquired through Revivification with Son in the Necralisk, Deimos. The player must capture a Weakened Panzer Vulpaphyla via Conservation (found only during Fass cycle) after it has been attacked by Infested, as well as obtain a Mutagen and Antigen bought from Son with Entrati Standing, and to initiate the Revivification process. A newly revived Vulpaphyla cannot be renamed, customized, Polarized or earn Mastery Rank experience, but can equip an Orokin Reactor. In order to unlock these features, the player must Gild their Vulpaphyla by achieving rank of Acquaintance with the Entrati, leveling the Vulpaphyla up to Rank 30 and then returning to Son along with 10 Son Token and 5,000 Standing.",
    "blueprint": "Vulpaphylas are acquired through Revivification with Son in the Necralisk, Deimos. The player must capture a Weakened Panzer Vulpaphyla via Conservation (found only during Fass cycle) after it has been attacked by Infested, as well as obtain a Mutagen and Antigen bought from Son with Entrati Standing, and to initiate the Revivification process. A newly revived Vulpaphyla cannot be renamed, customized, Polarized or earn Mastery Rank experience, but can equip an Orokin Reactor. In order to unlock these features, the player must Gild their Vulpaphyla by achieving rank of Acquaintance with the Entrati, leveling the Vulpaphyla up to Rank 30 and then returning to Son along with 10 Son Token and 5,000 Standing."
  },
