    "blueprint": "Available for from the Nightwave Cred Offerings store on a rotational basis. Range Advantage was originally acquired by reaching Rank 20 in Nightwave during Nora's Mix Volume 1. Beginning with Nightwave Nora\u2019s Mix: Vol. 7, it was added to the Nightwave Cred Offerings."
