    "general": `'''Secondary Encumber''' is a Secondary Arcane that, on a status effect from a secondary weapon, has a chance to apply an additional random status effect. Can be sold for . ==Effect== {| class="emodtable" |- ! Rank ! Chance to trigger |- | 0 || 4% |- | 1 || 8% |- | 2 || 12% |- | 3 || 16% |- | 4 || 20% |- | 5 || 24% |} {{Acquisition|*Secondary Encumber can be obtained from [[`,
