    "blueprint": "Thyst can be acquired from two different sources: Mined from blue mineral veins in Orb Vallis with the Advanced Nosam Cutter or the Sunpoint Plasma Drill, each yielding 1 unit. Also available from red veins in Orb Vallis upon hitting the square bracket bonus spot. Dropped as a common loot of Exploiter Orb, each loot yielding 7-8 units. On rarer occasions, the grand boss may drop multiple instances of the loot, making it possible to get 14-16 or even 21-24 units per kill."
