  borica: { name: "Borica", url: "https://wiki.warframe.com/w/Borica", revid: 2804624, fetched: "2026-10-03T20:35:15.619135Z", drops: [], otherSections: [{ heading: "Acquisition", text: "Borica can be harvested in the Deepmines Forward Base of Corporate Restructuring Deepmines Bounty. May be awarded randomly as a bonus bounty reward at the end of the mission, appearing just beside the extraction elevator. Can be purchased for 10 Fergolyte from Nightcap, requiring Rank 2 - Curious. Deepmines Forward Base (Stage 2-5 zone in Corporate Restructuring bounty) Winter Spear Weapons inflict Cold Damage. Greatly increases Movement Speed and Parkour Velocity, and greatly reduces Friction. Weapons inflict Impact Damage. Player is surrounded by particle effects similar to those of Prism. Enemies hit will likewise produce said particle effects. Spring Popper Weapons inflict Blast Damage. Enemies hit by weapons are thrown upwards with a Ragdoll effect. Weapons inflict Corrosive Damage." }, { heading: "Acquisition", text: "* can be harvested in the Deepmines Forward Base of Corporate Restructuring Deepmines Bounty." }] },
